      "title": "PhD scholarship in mineral resources - DTU Sustain",
      "description": "At DTU Sustain, you will break new ground by entering an interdisciplinary and international collaboration focusing on critical raw materials. We offer an exciting PhD project on understanding thermodynamic properties of REE ores.",
