      "title": "Professor in X-ray characterization, modelling and prediction of mechanical properties of composites materials for Wind energy applications - DTU Wind",
      "description": "If you are keen on contributing to the green transition, envisioning a planet running entirely on renewable energy, and looking for the best possible environment for fulfilling your dreams and ambitions, it is right here in front of you.",
