      "description": "We invite applicants to contribute to our mission of making fisheries sustainable through innovative technological solutions. We are looking for an ambitious researcher to strengthen DTU Aqua's research within fisheries technology, artificial intelligence and computer vision, with particular emphasis on their application to Electronic Monitoring and automated catch documentation.",
